# Agent kit

This project uses a tool-agnostic agent kit.

1. Read and follow root `AGENTS.md` first.
2. Load detail from `/agent/` as linked from `AGENTS.md` (rules, skills, docs, context, memory).
3. For repeatable workflows use `/agent/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
4. After non-trivial tasks, update `/agent/memory/session-log.md` and follow `/agent/improvement.md`.
5. To continue in a new chat, use `/agent/handoff.md`.
6. After stack changes, remind the user to run `npx @mapl6/agent-kit scan`.

Do not invent a parallel instruction system — keep improvements inside `/agent/` and `AGENTS.md`.
